      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;제약 생산을 위한 반자동 캡슐 충전 탐구 
    &lt;div id=&#34;제약-생산을-위한-반자동-캡슐-충전-탐구&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#%ec%a0%9c%ec%95%bd-%ec%83%9d%ec%82%b0%ec%9d%84-%ec%9c%84%ed%95%9c-%eb%b0%98%ec%9e%90%eb%8f%99-%ec%ba%a1%ec%8a%90-%ec%b6%a9%ec%a0%84-%ed%83%90%ea%b5%ac&#34; aria-label=&#34;앵커&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
